{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026AajN7mUon71795531484.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>行政長官李家超出席經民聯周年會慶致辭時，提出三個期望，包括繼續助力良政善治，激活發展動能，同協助政府回應市民所需。</p><p></p><p>行政長官李家超說：「特區政府重視與政黨的溝通協作，在行政主導下，行政立法機關良性互動，既互相制衡又互相配合，政黨是聯通政府、業界與廣大市民的橋樑，擔當著凝聚社會共識，推動政策制定和推行的重要角色。單絲不成線、獨木不成林，香港要實現高質量發展，需要政府、政黨、業界和市民戮力同心。」</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T16:03:52.981483+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":198,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T14:39:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T02:57:16.375661+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T15:57:15.876690+00:00","content_hash":"4826b4284ac556abbd16517d010efdadf611331b5073c03bd36583ab0b3870ea","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-24T16:03:52.981483+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}